+#if defined(__ORBIS__)
+/* PS4 homebrew: 192 GiB, in the application's map area, below 256 GiB: RADV's PS4 winsys searches for its GPU address
+   windows from 256 GiB, where SMW and Crema have them (0.1.0 put the guest there and RADV hung at its first mapping,
